      "content": "help, my bosch dishwasher is doing that e15 error again. i've been trying to look under the unit but it's so dark and the base is so cramped i can't really see anything. \n\nhonestly, it's actually kind of creeping me out. every time i get the light near the bottom, it feels like there's some kind of movement or skittering way back in the shadows where the hoses are, like something is nestled deep in there and shifting around. i can't tell if it's just debris or if a part is loose, but it feels like the water is being kept in some kind of hidden, busy little pocket underneath the motor.\n\ncan you just give me the direct steps to get that bottom area exposed so i can actually see what's going on? i need to find where that water is trapped and dry it out.",
